  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in crude prices directly raises expected near-term energy and transport costs, leading firms and households to revise up short- and medium-term inflation expectations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
