  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp rises in global oil prices raise production and transport costs and short‑term inflation, prompting risk‑off reallocations and reducing cross‑border equity and project finance into Taiwan's manufacturing and tech sectors.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
</edge>
