  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A rising rate of hostile or interdiction incidents in key sea lanes immediately raises transit delays, carrier cancellations and insurance costs, forcing Taiwanese exporters to cut shipment volumes and cadence.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
