  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased maritime disruptions delay or cancel shipment of specialized equipment and parts and discourage on‑site transfers and joint engineering visits, directly slowing cross‑border movement of technical know‑how and hardware.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
