  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in hostile or interdiction incidents in the Hormuz corridor triggers tighter licensing, sanctions enforcement and precautionary export-controls by the US and partners on shipments and dual‑use technologies transiting the region.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
