  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Sanctions on Russian oil and disruption of Black Sea exports force buyers (especially in Europe and Asia) to source more crude from Middle Eastern producers, increasing tanker departures and transits through the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
