  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Black Sea shipping disruptions, higher freight rates and insurance premia raised by the conflict increase costs and delays for global logistics, directly lowering the volume and timeliness of Taiwan's outbound manufactured shipments.</data>
