<edge source="taiwan_cross_strait::trade_restriction_level" target="global_currency_friction::fx_funding_stress" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">An abrupt increase in export controls or licensing on Taiwan tech and components forces corporates and suppliers to pre-fund imports and roll or extend USD hedges, sharply raising demand for dollar liquidity and widening cross‑currency basis spreads.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
  <data key="d40">global_currency_friction</data>
</edge>
<edge source="taiwan_cross_strait::trade_restriction_level" target="hormuz_standoff::maritime_incident_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalation of export controls on Taiwanese tech provokes PRC coercive signaling and forward naval/paramilitary deployments as deterrence and bargaining leverage, which increases harassment, interdiction attempts and close encounters by forces operating in distant but politically salient sea lanes including the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
  <data key="d40">hormuz_standoff</data>
</edge>
<edge source="taiwan_cross_strait::trade_restriction_level" target="russia_ukraine_war::component_availability" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter export controls or licensing restrictions on Taiwanese-origin advanced components and related tooling reduce the channels through which those parts reach intermediaries and end users, lowering the pool of drone components available to participants in the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">taiwan_cross_strait</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
