<edge source="global_currency_friction::policy_rate_level" target="hormuz_standoff::oil_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter policy interest rates in major economies raise borrowing costs and damp aggregate demand and commodity financing, reducing near‑term oil consumption and lowering spot crude prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_currency_friction</data>
  <data key="d40">hormuz_standoff</data>
